// The picture package: the reads and the writes a scene does to
// pictures that are not its own subject. Wrapped addressing, where
// `at_linear`'s clamp is the wrong edge; tone mapping, and the display
// graph that is usually the last node of a scene; mip levels, the
// strip and the reads that pick one, for a surface running away from
// the eye.
package picture@1 { language = 1; ir = 1; }

use "kernels/";
